7
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,380
We've helped

8
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:51,119
migrant workers,

9
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,060
women, children,

10
00:00:52,359 --> 00:00:54,320
(Sharing Light, Coming Together)
the elderly, and low-income groups.

11
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:57,299
Our network has grown to 32 law firms,

12
00:00:57,759 --> 00:01:00,079
(Sharing Light, Coming Together)
including Hengyuan Law Firm,

13
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:01,579
Xuanyang Law Firm,

14
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:03,439
Zhongjia Law Firm, among others.

15
00:01:04,680 --> 00:01:06,480
(Stories of those we've helped)

16
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:10,519
Now,

17
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:12,340
let me introduce...

18
00:01:45,100 --> 00:01:47,380
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

19
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:17,819
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

20
00:02:17,819 --> 00:02:18,599
Now,

21
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,780
let me introduce

22
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,979
Yuguang's plans for the next stage.

23
00:02:22,479 --> 00:02:23,159
First,

24
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:25,000
let's look at our strategy.

25
00:02:25,560 --> 00:02:26,539
In phase one...

26
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:30,000
(Partner firms and platforms)

27
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:34,700
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

28
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:37,400
Thank you, everyone.

29
00:02:37,599 --> 00:02:38,620
That's all from me.

30
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:40,500
See you next time.

31
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:45,920
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

32
00:02:58,099 --> 00:02:58,979
I'm Pei Yiqiu,

33
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,560
head of the overseas expert team

34
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,240
at Ruihe Medical Group.

35
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:03,439
I'm back

36
00:03:03,659 --> 00:03:05,219
as a clinical advisor

37
00:03:05,219 --> 00:03:06,960
for the Asia-Pacific region,

38
00:03:07,300 --> 00:03:08,439
with another key task.

39
00:03:09,259 --> 00:03:11,520
Ruihe and Yuguang plan to work closely

40
00:03:11,659 --> 00:03:13,280
on legal aid for patients

41
00:03:13,280 --> 00:03:14,159
and medical staff.

42
00:03:14,759 --> 00:03:16,719
I'll be your medical advisory contact.

43
00:03:17,180 --> 00:03:17,979
So I expect

44
00:03:18,479 --> 00:03:19,919
we'll be seeing a lot of each other.

45
00:03:26,759 --> 00:03:27,560
I'm Wen Wanqing,

46
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,099
founder of Yuguang Legal Aid Center.

47
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:32,039
We've been waiting a long time

48
00:03:33,180 --> 00:03:34,539
for this letter of intent.

49
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,159
Nice to meet you.

50
00:03:58,860 --> 00:03:59,659
I've met

51
00:04:00,719 --> 00:04:02,020
so many people

52
00:04:03,240 --> 00:04:04,840
and seen more of the world.

53
00:04:06,319 --> 00:04:07,800
But I still choose you.

54
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,680
Your ring...

55
00:04:12,900 --> 00:04:14,280
I put it on two years ago.

56
00:04:15,180 --> 00:04:15,860
Where's yours?

57
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:30,200
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

58
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:44,439
Nice!

59
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:58,879
(Yuguang Legal Aid Center)

60
00:04:58,879 --> 00:04:59,600
Dr. Pei.

61
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,620
Not even a bouquet for your proposal?

62
00:05:02,939 --> 00:05:04,319
That's a bit cheap, isn't it?

63
00:05:10,519 --> 00:05:11,240
I'll make it up to you at home.

64
00:05:14,510 --> 00:05:14,726
Okay.

65
00:05:33,319 --> 00:05:34,279
Who would've thought

66
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,199
the famous Mr. Gu

67
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:38,019
would be such a family man?

68
00:05:38,540 --> 00:05:39,480
These days,

69
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,519
I'm the breadwinner,
and he's the homemaker.

70
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:45,171
Oh!

71
00:05:45,720 --> 00:05:47,600
That was fast.

72
00:05:47,879 --> 00:05:49,319
You've only just got back!

73
00:05:52,379 --> 00:05:53,500
Not fast at all.

74
00:05:53,579 --> 00:05:54,839
He was away for two years.

75
00:05:58,347 --> 00:05:58,652
Hey!

76
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:02,079
Why don't we have a joint wedding?

77
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:03,920
We?

78
00:06:04,959 --> 00:06:05,839
You and Gu Yuan,

79
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:06,660
me and him.

80
00:06:06,839 --> 00:06:07,800
All four of us.

81
00:06:10,196 --> 00:06:10,780
Well...

82
00:06:11,579 --> 00:06:13,560
We got our certificate ages ago.

83
00:06:13,800 --> 00:06:15,680
Why bother with a wedding?

84
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,120
Didn't you put it off

85
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:19,279
because Qiu went abroad?

86
00:06:19,779 --> 00:06:20,800
I know

87
00:06:20,879 --> 00:06:22,920
you've always regretted missing out.

88
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:23,980
This time,

89
00:06:24,079 --> 00:06:25,240
let's do it together.

90
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:26,220
Don't worry.

91
00:06:26,399 --> 00:06:27,360
We'll do all the work.

92
00:06:27,579 --> 00:06:29,620
You just show up looking beautiful.

93
00:06:30,519 --> 00:06:33,040
You're truly my bestie.

94
00:06:33,660 --> 00:06:35,120
What are you laughing about?

95
00:06:36,160 --> 00:06:37,540
About when you'll feed us.

96
00:06:37,540 --> 00:06:38,600
Hurry. I'm starving.

97
00:06:38,879 --> 00:06:39,759
Almost ready.

98
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,540
Go help him.

99
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:47,399
Go on.

100
00:06:51,899 --> 00:06:52,560
I'll help.

101
00:06:52,759 --> 00:06:54,220
Turn on the stove and heat the pan.

102
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,500
- Don't burn yourself.
- There are doughnuts too.

103
00:06:57,319 --> 00:06:57,899
No, thanks.

104
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,420
We'll try on wedding gowns tomorrow.

105
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:24,220
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
